SILVA QIIME 2 Classifier Reference Files
========================================

These files are pre-built classifiers for taxonomic classification of amplicon 
sequencing data using QIIME2. They are derived from the SILVA database and 
formatted for direct use with QIIME2 platform.


Included Files
--------------
SILVA_144_SSURef_NR99_full-length_prokaryotes_rank-propagation_uniq_species_weighted_average_classifier.qza


Creation Details
----------------
Source Database: SILVA (https://www.arb-silva.de/)
SILVA Version:    144
QIIME2 Version:   2026.7.0
Clawback Version: 0.1.0+silva
Parameters:
- Region: full-length
- Primer Set: -----
- Taxonomic Ranks: prokaryotes
- Propagation: rank-propagation
- Dereplication Mode: uniq
- Habitat: average


How to Use
----------
Classify your sequences

qiime feature-classifier classify-sklearn \
  --i-classifier silva-138-99-515-806-nb-classifier.qza \
  --i-reads rep_seqs.qza \
  --o-classification taxonomy.qza

Visualize the results

qiime metadata tabulate \
  --m-input-file taxonomy.qza \
  --o-visualization taxonomy.qzv

Use taxonomy in downstream analyses
Examples: qiime taxa barplot, qiime taxa collapse, or diversity analyses.


QIIME2 Artifact Signature Verification
--------------------------------------
All QIIME2 artifacts (.qza files) in this release are cryptographically signed
with a GPG signature to ensure authenticity and integrity.

1. Import the public key:
   gpg --import SILVA_PUBLIC_KEY.asc

2. Verify the signature:
   qiime tools signature-verify \
    --input-path <artifact.qza> \
    --name 'SILVA-Pipeline-Official'

For more information about QIIME2 provenance and signatures, see:
https://use.qiime2.org/en/latest/how-to-guides/sign-and-verify-artifacts.html


